<title>ESTONIA: EVEA PANK MARCH CAPITAL ADEQUACY 20.9 PCT.</title>
<headline>EVEA PANK MARCH CAPITAL ADEQUACY 20.9 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEA Pank said on Tuesday that its capital adequacy was 20.9 percent for March.</p>
<p>In a brief statement, the bank said that its risk concentration was 237.1 percent, liquidity I was 66.4 percent, liqidity II 69.4 percent and liquidity III 38.0 percent.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
